{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】行政長官李家超下午又與智利總統卡斯特會面，見證簽署設立雙邊工作假期計劃協議，雙方每年各有100個名額。李家超指，很高興智利成為本港第一個拉丁美洲伙伴國家，相信協議可擴闊兩地青年視野，進一步促進兩地人文交流，為兩地的雙邊友好關係注入新動力。</p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T13:08:57.047951+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T12:38:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T13:02:25.796973+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T13:02:25.796973+00:00","content_hash":"86f66be4c1c8cfda3f200e9e8387ab237d26869075b1ac4f036ed7ef83a38487","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}